當久貧者邪?」遂與之婚。後避亂壽春，孫策見而異之，範遂自委暱，將私客百人歸策。時太妃在江都，策遣範迎之。徐州牧陶謙謂範為袁氏覘候，諷縣掠考範，範親客健兒篡取以歸。時唯範與孫河常從策，跨涉辛苦，危難不避，策亦親戚待之，每與升堂飲宴於太妃前。後從策攻破廬江，還俱東渡，到橫江、當利，破長英、於麋，下小丹楊、湖孰，領湖孰相。策定秣陵、曲阿，收笮融，劉繇餘眾，增範兵二千，騎五十匹。後領宛陵令，討破丹楊賊，還吳，遷都督。","source_term":"邑人劉氏，家富女美"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu056-lvfan-0","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"acw_tr7_8y2","label":"呂範妻母〔呂範求婚時嫌其貧〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvfan","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line045","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line045:m0041","quote":"母"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-lvfan","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line045:m0033"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line045"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line045:m0033","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line045:m0033"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-056-lvfan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relation